# v152 NOISE2 (ruling B4, FP-only audit). (a) An integer literal that STARTS the right-hand side of an assignment to a
# dotted member (Q.Length := 50000, Timer.Interval := 3000) is named by the member, as magic-literal already rules (N-12).
# (b) The default value of an INI read whose key literal names it (ReadInteger(Sec, 'TimeInJobFolder', 1800000)).
# Positive controls: a plain local target (12), a literal inside a larger rhs (13, 14), the same argument shape on a
# call that is not a Read* (17), and a literal after the Read* call (18).
!large-magic-number 9
!large-magic-number 10
!large-magic-number 11
large-magic-number 12
large-magic-number 13
large-magic-number 14
!large-magic-number 15
!large-magic-number 16
large-magic-number 17
large-magic-number 18